SUMMARY:Prospect Park Historic Carousel Community Rides
LOCATION:Prospect Park, 95 Prospect Park West, Brooklyn, NY 11215
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy rides on the park's hand-carved 1912 Charles Carmel carousel located in the Children's Corner, preserved by the Prospect Park Alliance.
